          "answer": 1,
          "explanation": "Hund is the direct object and masculine, so der becomes den."
        },
        {
          "id": "gd-a1-accusative-2",
          "type": "gap",
          "prompt": "Ich kaufe ___ Apfel.",
          "answers": ["einen"],
          "explanation": "Apfel is masculine and the direct object, so ein becomes einen."
        },
        {
          "id": "gd-a1-accusative-3",
