          "prompt": "Wir besuchen ___ Stadt.",
          "options": ["der", "den", "die", "dem"],
          "answer": 2,
          "explanation": "Stadt is feminine. Feminine articles do not change in the accusative: die Stadt."
        }
      ]
    },
